Package: com.python.ios.framework
Name: Python 3.14 Framework
Version: 3.14.7-1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: CPython 3.14 framework for rootful iOS
 An arm64 CPython runtime packaged with Python.framework and its standard
 library for use on a rootful iOS device.
Section: Interpreters
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Python iOS contributors
Author: Python iOS contributors
Depends: firmware, ca-certificates
